---LINES


mainv   = gh    -       -       -       -     "main view"
cmded   = gh    -       -       -       -     "command editor"
exiti   = gh    -       -       -       -     "exit code indicator"
hist    = gh    -       -       -       -     "history"
runcmd  = gm    -       -       -       -     "//run_a_command//.........."

---SCREEN                                     
=vash context switching diagram
 
.'--main_view_keys--                       .mainv............................. 
 * .:CA... - switch between main view and   ^   :               :       :      
     command editor, keeping both states    : .:CA...       .'[a-z]     :      
 * lowercase letters or '.' or '/':         :   :  .hist....    :   .'[0-9A-Z] 
   - type unix command from scratch  {1}    :   :   ^     :    {1}    :   :    
 * digit, uppercase, and other:             :   :   :     :     :    {2}  :    
   - edit a command from template    {2}    :   : .:HE... :     :     :  {3}   
   - run a command immediately       {3}    :   :   :     :     :     :   :    
                                            : .cmded..................... :    
.'--command_editor_keys--                   :          ^         :        :    
  .:NL... - run a command                 .:SP...      :       .:NL...    :    
  .:HE... - get history search view         :       .:AL...      :        :    
                                            :       .'[a-z]  .runcmd.......... 
.'--exit_code_indicator_keys--              :          :        :              
  .:NL... - trap for mistakes protection   .exiti................. <---        
  .:SP... - return to main view                                  ---> .:NL...  
  .:AL..., .:AU..., .:AD..., .:AR... - return to command editor                          
                                                      
 * main view keys may be vary, depending of used profile


